(text "Spec: claude/SatHunter-FG23-OTG-nyak-spec-2026-11-07 (project) and hardware/fg23-otg/README.md.  Parts and nets: generator/design.py (single source of truth)." (at 20.32 365.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee5c2af9-55d2-5838-9586-c26ebe120f4e))
(text "Checks: check_netlist.py (drawing == design.py), twin_check.py (netlist vs datasheets / firmware / pin map, self-test with injected faults)." (at 20.32 368.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3d591514-a313-5306-9894-ae3c83e17030))
(text "To verify before layout: HDF434A1-S6 and QPL9547 land patterns vs the maker drawings; 560 nH choke SRF; TCXO and RF ESD part numbers in the JLC tool." (at 20.32 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f020010c-7c73-506a-aa5d-2ef03705a12b))
(text "Layout: 4 layers JLC04161H-7628, RF CPWG ~50 ohm, shield can over SAW1 ... FG23 + TCXO, ESP antenna at a board edge with copper keep-out." (at 20.32 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d8e12b3d-5951-55e2-886d-954716e262db))
(text "In-band spurs to measure on rev A: 440 MHz (ESP 40 MHz x11), 429 MHz (39 MHz x11, SPI 19.5 MHz x22), 432 / 444 MHz (USB 12 / 48 MHz)." (at 20.32 375.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6637aea6-4706-5a39-94b5-ce955457a59c))
